    "diagnosis_basis": "The retained refusal is emitted only after all earlier native-observation channels, including R61 body-clearance contact provenance, validate. Immutable Godot source stamps the first completed step as zero_command=true, then immutable route source submits that observation as candidate_command. The core requires those identities to agree and therefore rejects deterministically before controller planning. The bound MuJoCo bootstrap demonstrates the intended distinction: a candidate bootstrap can request no actuation while retaining matched_zero_command=false."
